{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 在 S06 的“童年／初恋的下午”、S11 的“多年后走进旧房子”等意象略显强加联想，S13 也弱化了“谁也不能答应永远”这一重要心理支点，局部不如 X 自然、完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的关键词突出、感受字弱化并按音乐时机出现，观众可以先抓住人物每一步的心理变化，再从具体的声音、身体和环境感受中获得细节，不必同时处理两大块文字。X 的因果解释和前后叙事承接更完整，但左侧长句与右侧感受词需要来回对照，部分感受也比较泛化、重复。综合实际扫屏体验、段落要点的可获取性和感受的细腻程度，我选 Y，但它需要控制个别意象的过度阐释。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fcb1dded-d98e-4956-a635-9cbf02ce19ca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T061757804397Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.718, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:19:15.534846+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d5cf7c278e09f0586a34d04f2957b5ae63f39e2022c55b486823f5f8d2243952", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 